@startuml
 title Happy flow — буфер и распределительный центр свободны
 hide footbox
 autonumber
 participant "Календарь событий" as Calendar
 control "Ядро модели" as Engine
 participant "Источник ИБ / ИЗ2" as Source
 control "Диспетчер постановки ДП" as Admission
 queue "Буфер Д1ОЗ2" as Buffer
 control "Диспетчер выбора ДВ" as Scheduler
 control "Пул центров / указатель Д2П2" as Pool
 participant "Свободный распределительный центр" as Center
 participant "Статистика" as Stats

 Calendar -> Engine: OrderGenerated(sourceId, t)
 Engine -> Source: createOrder(t)
 Source --> Engine: order
 Engine -> Source: sampleInterArrival() [ИЗ2]
 Source --> Engine: Δt ~ U(Tmin,Tmax)
 Engine -> Calendar: scheduleArrival(sourceId, t + Δt)
 Engine -> Stats: recordGenerated(order)
 Engine -> Admission: onOrderGenerated(order)
 Admission -> Buffer: enqueueTail(order) [Д1ОЗ2]
 Buffer --> Admission: stored
 Admission --> Engine: accepted
 Engine -> Scheduler: onOrderAccepted(order.id, t)
 Scheduler -> Pool: findNextFreeFromPointer() [Д2П2]
 Pool --> Scheduler: Center свободен
 Scheduler -> Buffer: getWaitingOrders()
 Buffer --> Scheduler: [order]
 Scheduler -> Scheduler: Выбрать одну заявку по Д2Б4
 Scheduler -> Buffer: remove(orderId)
 Buffer --> Scheduler: order removed
 Scheduler -> Pool: markAssigned(Center)
 Pool -> Center: startService(order, t)
 Pool -> Pool: передвинуть указатель на следующий центр
 Center --> Pool: ServiceStarted
 Pool --> Scheduler: AssignmentConfirmed
 Scheduler -> Stats: recordServiceStarted(order, Center, t)
 Scheduler -> Calendar: schedule completion at t + Exp(μ) [ПЗ1]
 note over Admission, Scheduler
 ДП не обращается к центрам.
 Даже в happy flow заявка сначала проходит через буфер.
 end note
@enduml
